@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Salud — esperar 200
GET {{base}}/api/health
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

### Login demo — esperar 200
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

{"username": "ana", "password": "Demo123!"}

### Cuentas propias — esperar 200
GET {{base}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

### Retiro válido — esperar 201
POST {{base}}/api/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

{"source": "LAB-ANA-01", "amount": "50.00"}

### Transferencia válida — esperar 201
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

{"source": "LAB-ANA-01", "destination": "LAB-ANA-02", "amount": "10.25", "note": "Práctica Postman"}

### Saldo insuficiente — esperar 409
POST {{base}}/api/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

{"source": "LAB-ANA-01", "amount": "1000000"}

### Historial — esperar 200
GET {{base}}/api/history
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

### Cerrar sesión — esperar 200
POST {{base}}/api/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1

### Sin sesión — esperar 401
GET {{base}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Lab-Request: 1
